%[text] %[text:anchor:TMP_1066] # Visualize Field
%[text] This script provides a step-by-step exploration of the electrostatic dipole, guiding you through its physical principles, numerical modeling, and effective visualization techniques to deepen your understanding of electric fields.
%[text] [⇦ Main Menu](<matlab:open('MainMenu.m')>)
%[text] 
%[text]{"align":"center"} %[text:anchor:M_0736] ![](text:image:91b7)
%[text:tableOfContents]{"heading":"**Table of Contents**"}
%%
